        </li>
        <li class="property">
          <a class="property__link" href="https://www.goldengoosetools.com" rel="noopener">goldengoosetools.com</a>
          <span class="property__name">Golden Goose Tools</span>
          <span class="property__note">A brand of small tools, and where the research was first applied commercially. The technical SEO audit is live; the rest are unfinished.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="property">
          <a class="property__link" href="https://www.goldengoosetees.com" rel="noopener">goldengoosetees.com</a>
          <span class="property__name">Golden Goose Tees Studio</span>
          <span class="property__note">AI-assisted apparel design and fulfillment. Storefront in beta.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="property">
          <a class="property__link" href="https://www.researchone.io/" rel="noopener">researchone.io</a>
          <span class="property__name">ResearchOne</span>
          <span class="property__note">Research workspace that keeps sources attached. Private beta.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="room" id="funding" aria-labelledby="funding-title">
    <div class="suite suite--flagship">
      <p class="kicker">Funding</p>
      <h2 class="suite-title reveal" id="funding-title">Two funding tracks, kept separate.</h2>

